6. Full Medical Claim Specification
6.1 Medical Claim Schema
The medical claim schema defines the structure of a medical claim deposit.

It has the following fields:

claim_id. A string. Required.

claim_name. A string. Required.

claim_description. A string. Required.

condition. An array of strings. Required.

intervention. An object. Required. It contains intervention_type, intervention_name, and intervention_description.

outcome. An array of outcome objects. Required.

population. An object. Required. It contains population_description, age_range, and inclusion_criteria.

clinical_setting. An array of strings. Required.

evidence_for. An array of evidence objects. Required.

evidence_against. An array of evidence objects. Optional.

replication_status. An enum. Required. The values are not_replicated, replicated, partially_replicated, failed_replication, uncertain.

level_of_evidence. An enum. Required. The values are systematic_review, randomized_controlled_trial, cohort_study, case_control_study, case_series, case_report, expert_opinion, other.

grade_of_recommendation. An enum. Required. The values are strong_for, weak_for, weak_against, strong_against, uncertain.

safety_profile. An object. Required. It contains adverse_events, serious_adverse_events, and safety_signals.

conflicts_of_interest. An array of conflict objects. Optional.

funding_sources. An array of funding objects. Optional.

revisions. An array of revision objects. Optional.

related_claims. An array of claim relations. Optional.

provenance. An object. Required.

work_reference. A string. Optional.

full_pipeline_result_reference. A string. Optional.

null_model_result_reference. A string. Optional.

verification_result_reference. A string. Optional.

replication_tracker_reference. A string. Optional.

keywords. An array of strings. Optional.

notes. A string. Optional.

moderation_status. An enum. The values are pending, approved, rejected.

version. An integer.

supersedes. A string. Optional.

superseded_by. A string. Optional.

The intervention object has:

intervention_type. An enum. The values are drug, device, surgery, behavioural, lifestyle, diagnostic, preventive, other.

intervention_name. A string.

intervention_description. A string.

dose. A string. Optional.

duration. A string. Optional.

Each outcome object has:

outcome_id. A string.

outcome_name. A string.

outcome_type. An enum. The values are primary, secondary, safety, surrogate, patient_reported, other.

outcome_description. A string.

effect_size. An object. Optional. It contains value and units.

confidence_interval. An object. Optional. It contains lower and upper.

p_value. A number. Optional.

notes. A string. Optional.

Each evidence object has:

evidence_id. A string.

study_type. An enum. The values are systematic_review, meta_analysis, randomized_controlled_trial, cohort_study, case_control_study, case_series, case_report, expert_opinion, other.

study_reference. A string.

study_summary. A string.

sample_size. An integer. Optional.

population. A string. Optional.

effect_size. An object. Optional. It contains value and units.

confidence_interval. An object. Optional. It contains lower and upper.

p_value. A number. Optional.

quality. An enum. The values are high, moderate, low, very_low, not_assessed.

notes. A string. Optional.

The safety_profile object has:

adverse_events. An array of adverse event objects.

serious_adverse_events. An array of serious adverse event objects.

safety_signals. An array of safety signal objects.

Each adverse event object has:

event_id. A string.

event_name. A string.

event_frequency. An enum. The values are very_common, common, uncommon, rare, very_rare, unknown.

event_description. A string.

notes. A string. Optional.

Each serious adverse event object has:

event_id. A string.

event_name. A string.

event_description. A string.

notes. A string. Optional.

Each safety signal object has:

signal_id. A string.

signal_description. A string.

signal_status. An enum. The values are confirmed, potential, refuted, under_investigation.

notes. A string. Optional.

Each conflict object has:

conflict_id. A string.

conflict_type. An enum. The values are financial, personal, academic, institutional, other.

conflict_description. A string.

Each funding object has:

funding_id. A string.

funder_name. A string.

funder_type. An enum. The values are government, industry, non_profit, university, other.

funding_description. A string.

Each revision object has:

revision_id. A string.

revision_date. A string in ISO8601 format.

revision_description. A string.

previous_position. A string.

new_position. A string.

reason. A string.

source. A string.

notes. A string. Optional.

Each claim relation has:

relation_id. A string.

related_claim_id. A string.

relation_type. An enum. The values are same_condition, same_intervention, same_outcome, alternative, complement, related, independent.

relation_note. A string. Optional.

